      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dorr_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It received a United States post office in 1870.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
